title: "Total Cost of Ownership Estimator for Large Language Model Applications"
abstract: >-
  An independent cost model and interactive calculator for comparing hosted inference APIs
  with self-hosted open-weight model deployment, together with the replication material for
  the accompanying article: the analysis pipeline, the matched deployment cases, the
  cross-validation outputs, and the grey-literature appraisal records.
type: software
authors:
